  * *note noetherianOperators: noetherianOperators,
      * *note Strategy => "PunctualQuot": Strategy => "PunctualQuot",
      * *note Strategy => "MacaulayMatrix": Strategy => "MacaulayMatrix",
      * *note Strategy => "Hybrid": Strategy => "Hybrid",
  * *note specializedNoetherianOperators: specializedNoetherianOperators,
  * *note numericalNoetherianOperators: numericalNoetherianOperators,
  * *note getIdealFromNoetherianOperators: getIdealFromNoetherianOperators,
  * *note getModuleFromNoetherianOperators: getModuleFromNoetherianOperators,
  * *note coordinateChangeOps: coordinateChangeOps,
  * *note noethOpsFromComponents: noethOpsFromComponents,
  * *note solvePDE: solvePDE_lpModule_rp,
  * *note differentialPrimaryDecomposition: differentialPrimaryDecomposition,

Methods for numerically computing and manipulating local dual spaces:

  * *note truncatedDual: truncatedDual,
  * *note zeroDimensionalDual: zeroDimensionalDual,
  * *note eliminatingDual: eliminatingDual,
  * *note localHilbertRegularity: localHilbertRegularity,
  * *note gCorners: gCorners,
