|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : U = image matrix{{x1*x2,x2*x3,x3*x4,x4*x1}, {x1^2,x2^2,x3^2,x4^2}}      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = image | x1x2 x2x3 x3x4 x1x4 |                                           |
|           | x1^2 x2^2 x3^2 x4^2 |                                           |
|                                                                             |
|                             2                                               |
|o2 : R-module, submodule of R                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : amult U                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
