evaluate(DiffOp,AbstractPoint) -- evaluate coefficients of a differential operator
**********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note evaluate: (NAGtypes)evaluate,
  * Usage: 
        evaluate(D, p)
  * Inputs:
      * D, a *note differential operator: DiffOp,, 
      * p, a *note point: (NAGtypes)AbstractPoint,, or a one-row *note matrix:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note differential operator: DiffOp,, 

Description
===========

Evaluates the polynomial coefficients of a *note differential operator: DiffOp,
at a point. This can be used to obtain a set of specialized Noetherian
operators.

+------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];             |
+------------------------------+
|i2 : S = diffOpRing R;        |
+------------------------------+
|i3 : D = diffOp(x*dx+y*dy^3)  |
|                              |
|o3 = | ydy^3+xdx |            |
|                              |
|                1             |
|o3 : DiffOp in S              |
+------------------------------+
|i4 : evaluate(D, point{{1,2}})|
|                              |
