getModuleFromNoetherianOperators -- Computes a primary submodule corresponding to a list of Noetherian operators and a prime ideal
**********************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        U = getModuleFromNoetherianOperators(P, L)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a prime ideal
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of *note differential operators:
        DiffOp,
  * Outputs:
      * U, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, the primary submodule
