|i2 : I = ideal{x^2,x*y}                     |
|                                            |
|             2                              |
|o2 = ideal (x , x*y)                        |
|                                            |
|o2 : Ideal of R                             |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i3 : d = localHilbertRegularity(origin R, I)|
|                                            |
|o3 = 2                                      |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i4 : D = truncatedDual(origin R, I, 3)      |
|                                            |
|o4 = | 1 y x .5y2 .166667y3 |               |
|                                            |
|o4 : DualSpace                              |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i5 : L = hilbertFunction({0,1,2,3}, D)      |
|                                            |
|o5 = {1, 2, 1, 1}                           |
|                                            |
|o5 : List                                   |
+--------------------------------------------+

